1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,168
Come on out, first student!

2
00:00:02,758 --> 00:00:06,272
[LOL]

3
00:00:06,272 --> 00:00:09,242
[Everyone's dopamine level is maxed out]

4
00:00:10,105 --> 00:00:11,010
Why are you laughing?

5
00:00:11,012 --> 00:00:12,945
[Who made everyone laugh?]

6
00:00:12,945 --> 00:00:14,368
[Beautiful ASA-lisa]

7
00:00:14,369 --> 00:00:16,370
Isn't she beautiful?

8
00:00:18,852 --> 00:00:21,673
Next!

9
00:00:21,675 --> 00:00:23,208
Come on out, RORA!

10
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:26,057
[LOL x2]

11
00:00:26,728 --> 00:00:29,835
Does anyone need tissue?

12
00:00:29,836 --> 00:00:35,167
[Why have they become Mona Lisa & tissue?]
Do you understand how scary it is now?

13
00:00:35,167 --> 00:00:40,680
[The Silence of IDOL:
BABYMONSTER]

14
00:00:40,682 --> 00:00:43,317
[Night has arrived
after a hectic schedule]

15
00:00:43,317 --> 00:00:44,652
Now that we took a shower,

16
00:00:44,652 --> 00:00:45,652
I want to go to bed.

17
00:00:45,654 --> 00:00:46,579
[The schedule of the retreat was crazy]
Right?

18
00:00:46,581 --> 00:00:47,155
I'm so sleepy.

19
00:00:47,155 --> 00:00:50,490
I'm going to sleep now. I'm sleepy.

20
00:00:50,491 --> 00:00:53,426
Isn't this bed too small?

21
00:00:53,427 --> 00:00:55,630
I don't think the seven of us can sleep here.

22
00:00:55,631 --> 00:00:57,331
I should sleep on the floor.

23
00:00:57,332 --> 00:00:59,267
[Flop]
I'll just sleep here.

24
00:01:00,603 --> 00:01:01,746
[Knock knock]

25
00:01:02,771 --> 00:01:03,718
[Someone is at the door]
Who can it be?

26
00:01:03,719 --> 00:01:05,406
- Who is this?
- A ghost?

27
00:01:05,406 --> 00:01:07,707
[Did anyone order anything?]

28
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:11,212
[LOL]

29
00:01:11,212 --> 00:01:14,649
[An extra mattress has arrived]
Here's your mattress.

30
00:01:14,650 --> 00:01:17,018
Can you give me some space?

31
00:01:18,206 --> 00:01:19,819
Your Korean is very good-yo!

32
00:01:19,820 --> 00:01:22,945
[So hiphop]

33
00:01:23,926 --> 00:01:26,060
Okay. I'll get going then.

34
00:01:26,727 --> 00:01:29,162
[Everyone panics]
Wait. Are you just leaving it here?

35
00:01:29,164 --> 00:01:33,334
It's super easy so install it yourselves.

36
00:01:34,533 --> 00:01:35,936
[Gotcha]
Okay.

37
00:01:35,938 --> 00:01:37,037
- Okay. Bye.
- Thank you.

38
00:01:38,873 --> 00:01:40,373
[Start to work on it]
We're just like the kids at a retreat.

39
00:01:40,375 --> 00:01:42,209
[Playfulness also starts]

40
00:01:42,209 --> 00:01:43,343
Hold the ends.

41
00:01:43,344 --> 00:01:44,680
[Tight 1 / Tight 2]
Hold them.

42
00:01:44,683 --> 00:01:46,183
[I'll pull RAMI]

43
00:01:47,555 --> 00:01:49,650
[It's become a game of pulling RAMI]

44
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:53,353
[The matress is out in no time]

45
00:01:53,355 --> 00:01:54,789
It's like gimbap.

46
00:01:54,790 --> 00:01:56,954
[Just by cutting the wrapper]
Let's go.

47
00:01:56,956 --> 00:01:57,793
Oh, cool!

48
00:01:57,793 --> 00:02:01,162
[Good job, RAMI]

49
00:02:01,162 --> 00:02:03,129
I did it!

50
00:02:03,131 --> 00:02:07,200
[The mattress inflates by itself]

51
00:02:09,424 --> 00:02:11,872
[Peekaboo]

52
00:02:11,872 --> 00:02:14,424
[#Mattress #Installation #Success]

53
00:02:14,425 --> 00:02:15,276
But since

54
00:02:15,276 --> 00:02:16,610
it (the mattress) is wrapped airtight,

55
00:02:16,611 --> 00:02:18,312
all we needed to do was take it out.

56
00:02:18,312 --> 00:02:20,514
- Exactly.
- How convenient.

57
00:02:20,514 --> 00:02:22,650
It just takes one person to do it.

58
00:02:22,653 --> 00:02:25,823
[Suddenly everyone wants to dive in]

59
00:02:26,925 --> 00:02:27,544
Take a seat.

60
00:02:27,756 --> 00:02:29,896
[They found their favorite bed here]
I love it.

61
00:02:29,897 --> 00:02:30,959
We can sleep here.

62
00:02:30,959 --> 00:02:33,193
[Now that the bed is here, it's time to sleep]
Here...

63
00:02:33,198 --> 00:02:34,643
[Rummaging through]

64
00:02:34,644 --> 00:02:36,433
[Someone hid a lemon candy here]

65
00:02:37,419 --> 00:02:39,451
[Special item]
What is it? A candy?

66
00:02:39,453 --> 00:02:41,453
[Everyone's eyes are on it]
What is it?

67
00:02:42,216 --> 00:02:43,903
Who wants to have a candy?

68
00:02:43,905 --> 00:02:46,706
[Everyone loves a candy]
Me?

69
00:02:46,707 --> 00:02:48,475
We'll play a game to make it fair.

70
00:02:48,477 --> 00:02:50,211
[A game? I'm down!]
A game?

71
00:02:50,211 --> 00:02:51,611
['A bed battle' for a lemon candy]

72
00:02:51,612 --> 00:02:56,250
[Push your competitor out of the bed
while sitting down!]

73
00:02:56,251 --> 00:02:58,818
[The last one standing will be the winner]

74
00:02:59,687 --> 00:03:02,599
[Chanting FOREVER as a cheer]

75
00:03:02,603 --> 00:03:03,542
Here we go!

76
00:03:03,543 --> 00:03:04,932
[The Bed Battle begins now]

77
00:03:06,687 --> 00:03:07,667
This is...

78
00:03:07,668 --> 00:03:08,729
I'm not up.

79
00:03:08,729 --> 00:03:10,364
[Rolling]

80
00:03:10,365 --> 00:03:11,831
Push her out!

81
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,835
[Rolling]
Come here.

82
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:16,674
[RAMI took care of the two in a second]

83
00:03:17,806 --> 00:03:19,139
[PHARITA is out too]

84
00:03:19,140 --> 00:03:20,206
[RORA is scared]

85
00:03:20,207 --> 00:03:22,475
[RORA backs down as a strategy]
Just quit.

86
00:03:23,502 --> 00:03:25,079
[An easy win]

87
00:03:25,913 --> 00:03:28,181
[The winner of the bed battle]
RAMI is the winner!

88
00:03:28,432 --> 00:03:29,950
Congratulations.

89
00:03:29,950 --> 00:03:31,852
[RAMI got the lemon candy]
My candy.

90
00:03:31,853 --> 00:03:33,039
That was super fun.

91
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:35,395
[Whistle-!!!]

92
00:03:38,133 --> 00:03:39,461
[Flying in the air]

93
00:03:39,462 --> 00:03:41,122
Just what are you doing now?

94
00:03:41,123 --> 00:03:43,264
What are you doing?

95
00:03:43,264 --> 00:03:45,665
Aren't you the delivery guy?

96
00:03:45,667 --> 00:03:46,514
[He seems familiar]
We've met, no?

97
00:03:46,514 --> 00:03:47,401
He has two jobs.

98
00:03:47,401 --> 00:03:49,370
[It's hard to make ends meet]

99
00:03:49,371 --> 00:03:51,806
[LOL]

100
00:03:51,806 --> 00:03:53,371
RAMI!

101
00:03:53,372 --> 00:03:56,509
[Me..?]
RAMI!

102
00:03:56,510 --> 00:03:58,111
What do you have in your hand?

103
00:03:58,112 --> 00:03:59,697
Nothing.

104
00:03:59,698 --> 00:04:03,610
I saw something yellow.

105
00:04:03,610 --> 00:04:04,752
That's yellow.

106
00:04:04,752 --> 00:04:07,121
Oh, my  hair?

107
00:04:07,122 --> 00:04:08,254
Mine's yellow, too.

108
00:04:08,256 --> 00:04:09,356
[LOL]

109
00:04:09,356 --> 00:04:11,891
Not that. Give me that!

110
00:04:12,394 --> 00:04:15,695
What happens if you eat a candy
before you go to bed?

111
00:04:15,697 --> 00:04:17,331
It's yummy!

112
00:04:21,036 --> 00:04:22,702
[I get that]
It is yummy.

113
00:04:22,704 --> 00:04:24,404
Your teeth will rot.

114
00:04:24,673 --> 00:04:25,805
No.

115
00:04:25,807 --> 00:04:27,942
[Momentary pause]

116
00:04:27,942 --> 00:04:29,310
I'm confiscating it.

117
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:30,103
He's confiscating it!

118
00:04:31,779 --> 00:04:33,413
[Baby Florian]
I had this a lot when I was a baby.

119
00:04:36,016 --> 00:04:39,452
Make sure you clean up your bed first
and go to sleep.

120
00:04:39,454 --> 00:04:41,521
[Talent show D-DAY is tomorrow]

121
00:04:41,523 --> 00:04:42,711
[Practice the dance move for the talent show!]
When I see you

122
00:04:42,711 --> 00:04:44,692
practicing for the talent show,

123
00:04:44,692 --> 00:04:46,692
I'll take that as you don't want to sleep,

124
00:04:46,694 --> 00:04:50,036
[Sleeping item or Penalty item!]
so I'll make sure you fall asleep forever.

125
00:04:50,038 --> 00:04:52,466
Everyone, go to sleep!

126
00:04:52,466 --> 00:04:55,235
[After playing, everyone's all in bed]

127
00:04:55,237 --> 00:04:57,471
This pillow is so comfy and cool.

128
00:04:57,471 --> 00:04:59,372
Right?

129
00:04:59,374 --> 00:05:01,375
I felt a bit hot while playing the game,

130
00:05:01,375 --> 00:05:02,942
but I can feel myself cooling down.

131
00:05:02,944 --> 00:05:05,278
This is great for hot weather.

132
00:05:05,279 --> 00:05:07,781
It was so comfy that I dozed off for a bit.

133
00:05:07,783 --> 00:05:08,423
I did, too.

134
00:05:08,423 --> 00:05:09,283
It's so comfy.

135
00:05:09,283 --> 00:05:11,351
[It's the best bedding item]
I want to take this home.

136
00:05:11,915 --> 00:05:12,987
[Sitting up suddenly]

137
00:05:13,321 --> 00:05:15,156
Hang on a second.

138
00:05:15,156 --> 00:05:16,415
Wake up! Wake up!

139
00:05:16,416 --> 00:05:17,690
[Everyone, wake up!]

140
00:05:17,692 --> 00:05:20,226
Tomorrow is the talent show.

141
00:05:20,228 --> 00:05:22,228
We shouldn't let the seniors students

142
00:05:22,230 --> 00:05:24,398
beat us.

143
00:05:24,399 --> 00:05:25,533
No way.

144
00:05:25,533 --> 00:05:28,101
Let's go all the way.

145
00:05:28,103 --> 00:05:30,336
[Talent show]
Let's practice hard and go to sleep.

146
00:05:30,338 --> 00:05:31,286
I'll turn it on.

147
00:05:31,286 --> 00:05:33,240
[Play]
Let me press 'play'.

148
00:05:33,952 --> 00:05:34,875
[Rushing]

149
00:05:34,875 --> 00:05:37,043
[Alright ok]

150
00:05:38,779 --> 00:05:40,713
[Alright ok]

151
00:05:41,346 --> 00:05:42,552
[BABYMONSTER]

152
00:05:45,019 --> 00:05:47,221
(Avoiding the instructor) Should we turn off the music?

153
00:05:47,221 --> 00:05:49,656
[Instructor, Say goodbye]

154
00:05:53,028 --> 00:05:54,661
Let's be professional.

155
00:05:54,663 --> 00:05:56,831
[Let me clap my hands professionally]

156
00:05:58,709 --> 00:06:00,507
[Beep!]

157
00:06:00,507 --> 00:06:05,577
[Somebody help BABYMONSTER]

158
00:06:08,257 --> 00:06:10,213
[Rolling]

159
00:06:14,014 --> 00:06:15,815
What's going on?

160
00:06:16,483 --> 00:06:18,084
Are you sure you're asleep?

161
00:06:18,954 --> 00:06:20,954
This won't do.

162
00:06:22,745 --> 00:06:24,091
[Getting up]

163
00:06:25,721 --> 00:06:27,523
It's cold.

164
00:06:27,528 --> 00:06:28,562
- Are you cold?
- Yes.

165
00:06:28,562 --> 00:06:31,298
[LOL]

166
00:06:31,932 --> 00:06:34,468
Are you comfortable like that?

167
00:06:35,437 --> 00:06:37,178
What's going on?

168
00:06:37,930 --> 00:06:40,708
I guess you rolled out of your bed.

169
00:06:40,709 --> 00:06:42,776
[Going back to bed, acting as if nothing happened]

170
00:06:42,776 --> 00:06:44,879
[LOL]

171
00:06:46,213 --> 00:06:47,247
Everyone, close your eyes.

172
00:06:49,050 --> 00:06:50,149
[Standing right back up]

173
00:06:50,151 --> 00:06:52,552
What are you doing still up?

174
00:06:53,774 --> 00:06:54,648
Everyone's asleep.

175
00:06:54,649 --> 00:06:55,588
Again.

176
00:06:55,589 --> 00:06:57,725
[Practicing again, mimicking Instructor Florian]

177
00:06:58,148 --> 00:06:59,372
It's me.

178
00:07:00,730 --> 00:07:02,930
[I'm performing my part although it's hectic]

179
00:07:04,432 --> 00:07:08,569
[Laser focused]
Come on.

180
00:07:10,071 --> 00:07:12,005
Where's my partner?

181
00:07:12,007 --> 00:07:14,274
[CHIQUITA is back]

182
00:07:14,276 --> 00:07:16,036
[RAMI is guarding the door]

183
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,245
[RUKA's part is coming up]
Go dance!

184
00:07:19,247 --> 00:07:21,115
[Guarding the door till the end]

185
00:07:21,877 --> 00:07:23,252
[Hurry back]

186
00:07:23,252 --> 00:07:26,887
[What you waiting for]

187
00:07:26,887 --> 00:07:30,423
[Everyone is in sync]

188
00:07:31,725 --> 00:07:32,526
Do it properly!

189
00:07:34,562 --> 00:07:36,863
[Having fun mimicking Instructor]
What are you doing still up?

190
00:07:37,297 --> 00:07:39,062
[Did you call me?]

191
00:07:39,062 --> 00:07:40,963
[Hurry back]

192
00:07:44,639 --> 00:07:46,432
What's with the door?

193
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:47,507
[Why can't I open it?]
Open it!

194
00:07:47,509 --> 00:07:49,209
[LOL]

195
00:07:49,209 --> 00:07:51,345
Get rid of this matress now!

196
00:07:51,637 --> 00:07:53,196
Okay.

197
00:07:53,348 --> 00:07:54,848
Who did this?

198
00:07:54,848 --> 00:07:56,718
[LOL]

199
00:07:56,718 --> 00:07:58,285
If there's any bed left...

200
00:07:58,918 --> 00:07:59,620
There's none.

201
00:08:00,060 --> 00:08:01,338
[Lying on the floor]

202
00:08:04,024 --> 00:08:05,259
This won't do.

203
00:08:05,259 --> 00:08:09,163
You're one team at this retreat.

204
00:08:09,163 --> 00:08:11,365
You are a team.

205
00:08:11,365 --> 00:08:13,934
Even if I catch just one of you,

206
00:08:13,935 --> 00:08:15,427
you'll have to participate

207
00:08:15,428 --> 00:08:20,374
in a group mission as a whole.

208
00:08:20,375 --> 00:08:23,009
Everyone make a line!

209
00:08:23,011 --> 00:08:26,269
1, 2, 3. Get up!

210
00:08:27,548 --> 00:08:29,516
If you succeed in the group mission,

211
00:08:29,516 --> 00:08:30,985
I'll get you an item

212
00:08:30,992 --> 00:08:34,226
so you can sleep better.

213
00:08:34,227 --> 00:08:35,755
That is, if you succeed.

214
00:08:35,756 --> 00:08:36,756
But!

215
00:08:36,758 --> 00:08:42,028
If you fail, you'll be given a penalty item.

216
00:08:42,029 --> 00:08:46,600
Your group mission is to become a human fan.

217
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:52,339
The seven of you will have to pose
in the shape of a fan and stay that way.

218
00:08:52,340 --> 00:08:55,542
Start now!

219
00:08:55,543 --> 00:08:57,413
[Deciding the order first]
I'll go fourth.

220
00:08:57,414 --> 00:08:59,513
- I'll go third.
- I'm good as long as I'm not the first.

221
00:09:00,749 --> 00:09:02,316
That's the first.

222
00:09:02,317 --> 00:09:03,817
The one here

223
00:09:03,817 --> 00:09:05,152
must be strong.

224
00:09:05,153 --> 00:09:06,172
That's not me.

225
00:09:06,173 --> 00:09:07,389
[LOL]

226
00:09:07,389 --> 00:09:09,490
[Who is the strongest baby?]
Who's the strongest?

227
00:09:09,490 --> 00:09:11,191
[It's me]
CHIQUITA.

228
00:09:11,192 --> 00:09:13,126
[Changed to CHIQUITA]
Lie down here.

229
00:09:13,128 --> 00:09:14,293
[Human Fan]
Okay. Go!

230
00:09:15,562 --> 00:09:17,697
You should go down more.

231
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:19,681
Everyone should depend on each other.

232
00:09:19,682 --> 00:09:21,235
Why is it so far?

233
00:09:21,235 --> 00:09:22,270
Okay. Come on.

234
00:09:23,616 --> 00:09:26,840
1, 2, 3, 4.

235
00:09:26,841 --> 00:09:29,842
Go on! Make the fan shape.

236
00:09:29,844 --> 00:09:30,793
[AHYEON and CHIQUITA is a palm away]

237
00:09:30,794 --> 00:09:32,201
Give me your hand.

238
00:09:32,346 --> 00:09:33,980
Get up!

239
00:09:36,116 --> 00:09:36,923
I'm sweating.

240
00:09:37,620 --> 00:09:40,287
That was okay.

241
00:09:40,288 --> 00:09:41,889
Although it wasn't perfect,

242
00:09:41,889 --> 00:09:44,857
[I commend your effort]
it was okay as the first mission.

243
00:09:44,859 --> 00:09:46,927
[Perfect angle]
Thank you. Salute!

244
00:09:46,927 --> 00:09:49,797
Since you nailed the first mission,

245
00:09:49,798 --> 00:09:52,115
I'll give you an item to sleep well.

246
00:09:53,981 --> 00:09:57,690
Come forward, CHIQUITA and RAMI.

247
00:09:57,691 --> 00:09:59,349
Yes, sir!

248
00:09:59,350 --> 00:10:00,833
- It's an eye mask.
- How cute.

249
00:10:00,835 --> 00:10:02,176
Thank you.

250
00:10:02,177 --> 00:10:04,677
Wear it now.

251
00:10:05,245 --> 00:10:06,145
Give me a cute pose.

252
00:10:09,183 --> 00:10:12,385
I'm cute even if I'm not doing anything.

253
00:10:12,386 --> 00:10:14,865
[LOL]

254
00:10:14,865 --> 00:10:15,989
1, 2, 3.

255
00:10:15,990 --> 00:10:17,890
[A sleeping fairy pose]
Good. That's it!

256
00:10:17,892 --> 00:10:18,792
[Tapping]

257
00:10:18,793 --> 00:10:19,725
Go to bed now!

258
00:10:20,294 --> 00:10:21,628
I'll get going, then.

259
00:10:22,331 --> 00:10:23,519
[LOL]

260
00:10:23,519 --> 00:10:24,096
[Shh!]

261
00:10:24,620 --> 00:10:26,133
Good night.

262
00:10:26,134 --> 00:10:28,601
[Not really, get up!]

263
00:10:28,937 --> 00:10:31,038
- Shall we practice again?
- Cool.

264
00:10:31,038 --> 00:10:31,981
[Play]

265
00:10:33,176 --> 00:10:34,293
CHIQUITA, you're at the center.

266
00:10:37,399 --> 00:10:44,918
[FOREVER]

267
00:10:44,918 --> 00:10:47,988
[LIKE I'MMA LIVE]

268
00:10:48,770 --> 00:10:49,923
[BABYMONSTER]

269
00:10:52,110 --> 00:10:52,759
[I'm that nice]

270
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:53,793
[What do you think makes us different?]

271
00:10:53,794 --> 00:10:56,096
