542
00:21:16,016 --> 00:21:18,518
[What?]
[LOL]

543
00:21:18,519 --> 00:21:19,919
She's from somewhere very far.

544
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:21,721
Come on out, RUKA.

545
00:21:21,721 --> 00:21:25,121
[What the heck?]

546
00:21:26,227 --> 00:21:27,527
So cute.

547
00:21:27,528 --> 00:21:29,028
[It was good that they failed the last mission]

548
00:21:29,028 --> 00:21:30,266
[It's like RUKA was born this way]
You'll sleep like this.

549
00:21:30,267 --> 00:21:32,432
It suits RUKA so well.

550
00:21:32,432 --> 00:21:34,666
Act like the alien is kidnapping you.

551
00:21:34,667 --> 00:21:35,535
Like this?

552
00:21:37,605 --> 00:21:39,739
I finally got RUKA!

553
00:21:39,740 --> 00:21:42,474
[LOL]

554
00:21:42,476 --> 00:21:44,743
No more practicing!

555
00:21:44,744 --> 00:21:48,882
Sleep with your alien friend
till the morning comes.

556
00:21:50,384 --> 00:21:51,917
You should use the mattress by yourself.

557
00:21:51,919 --> 00:21:53,419
[Flops]
[Pfft]

558
00:21:53,420 --> 00:21:54,253
[LOL]

559
00:21:54,255 --> 00:21:55,622
[RUKA & the alien made the instructor laugh]

560
00:21:55,623 --> 00:21:57,236
RUKA, at least take
your shoes off and go to sleep.

561
00:21:57,237 --> 00:21:58,291
[Come on]

562
00:21:58,291 --> 00:22:00,125
[Chaos]
The instructor is laughing.

563
00:22:00,594 --> 00:22:02,729
[Now that it's sorted]
"They are sleeping well~"

564
00:22:02,730 --> 00:22:04,530
[Standing up]
[Acting different to their words]

565
00:22:04,531 --> 00:22:07,567
[The girls have no intention of sleeping]

566
00:22:07,567 --> 00:22:09,736
[Standing up by the help of others.]
It's okay.

567
00:22:09,737 --> 00:22:12,538
My alien friend hasn't eaten.

568
00:22:12,539 --> 00:22:14,773
He's gone.

569
00:22:14,775 --> 00:22:16,041
He's dead.

570
00:22:16,042 --> 00:22:18,044
Bring him back to life.

571
00:22:18,045 --> 00:22:20,680
[Let's practice and save your friend]

572
00:22:24,967 --> 00:22:26,419
[FOREVER]

573
00:22:27,249 --> 00:22:30,041
[Unification of humans and the alien by dancing]

574
00:22:32,358 --> 00:22:36,962
[BABYMONSTER and the alien are having fun]

575
00:22:36,963 --> 00:22:39,332
[She fell down after laughing too hard]

576
00:22:39,333 --> 00:22:40,900
[FOREVER]

577
00:22:42,047 --> 00:22:42,701
[Kiss]

578
00:22:42,702 --> 00:22:45,238
[Practice for the talent show is over]

579
00:22:45,605 --> 00:22:47,707
We were perfect.

580
00:22:47,708 --> 00:22:50,542
- Perfect.
- That's right.

581
00:22:50,544 --> 00:22:51,943
I guess the alien wants to take a rest.

582
00:22:51,944 --> 00:22:53,075
[Is that so?]

583
00:22:53,076 --> 00:22:54,248
He says it was tiring.

584
00:22:55,148 --> 00:22:57,250
Let's go to sleep.

585
00:22:57,250 --> 00:22:59,751
[Finally, the girls go to bed]

586
00:23:01,842 --> 00:23:03,125
[I'm here, too!]

587
00:23:03,125 --> 00:23:04,090
Good night.

588
00:23:04,090 --> 00:23:05,057
Bye.

589
00:23:05,558 --> 00:23:07,626
[Good night, everyone]

590
00:23:07,627 --> 00:23:14,634
[Please look forward to the full version
of BABYMONSTER sleeping]

591
00:23:15,517 --> 00:23:19,571
[With the familiar sound]

592
00:23:19,578 --> 00:23:22,248
[Here comes the instructor]
Get up, everyone!

593
00:23:22,643 --> 00:23:24,309
Everyone, up!

594
00:23:24,310 --> 00:23:25,096
Yes, sir.

595
00:23:25,778 --> 00:23:27,380
Did you sleep well with the Greenie?

596
00:23:27,381 --> 00:23:29,548
Greenie is sick.

597
00:23:29,549 --> 00:23:31,151
[Crumpled]
Greenie is sick.

598
00:23:31,151 --> 00:23:33,019
Why has he gone so flat?

599
00:23:33,019 --> 00:23:35,520
[Out of nowhere]
He's sick because of you.

600
00:23:35,521 --> 00:23:38,290
[Whatever]
Get up!

601
00:23:38,291 --> 00:23:39,925
It's time for the talent show.

602
00:23:39,926 --> 00:23:41,160
Right!

603
00:23:42,354 --> 00:23:45,030
Today is the talent show.

604
00:23:45,031 --> 00:23:47,799
[Let's slay the stage, Greenie!]
Get up!

605
00:23:47,800 --> 00:23:50,002
We shouldn't let the senior students

606
00:23:50,003 --> 00:23:51,703
to walk all over us.

607
00:23:51,704 --> 00:23:53,138
[Let's go, BABYMONSTER!]
Let's go slay the stage.

608
00:23:53,140 --> 00:23:55,023
Greenie should go to the ER.

609
00:23:56,644 --> 00:23:58,217
Greenie is dead.

610
00:23:58,218 --> 00:24:00,075
Bye.

611
00:24:02,862 --> 00:24:06,172
Do you know there's a fan meeting in Seoul
in August?

612
00:24:06,173 --> 00:24:07,509
- Whose?
- BABYMONSTER.

613
00:24:07,510 --> 00:24:09,510
BABYMONSTER?

614
00:24:11,112 --> 00:24:12,597
I know!

615
00:24:12,598 --> 00:24:16,102
We're performing 'FOREVER'
by BABYMONSTER tomorrow.

616
00:24:16,788 --> 00:24:18,237
Will we get to listen to them performing live?

617
00:24:19,314 --> 00:24:20,238
Probably?

